00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,576
In scope for UAE e-invoicing?

2
00:00:02,576 --> 00:00:06,266
Your financial statements decide which phase.

3
00:00:06,966 --> 00:00:19,230
The Ministry of Finance guidelines measure revenue as gross income in the most recent accounting period, from financial statements prepared under UAE law.

4
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:24,566
AED 50 million is the line between Phase 1 and Phase 2.

5
00:00:25,266 --> 00:00:35,314
So the monthly pack should tie revenue to the ledger, entity by entity, reconcile the balance sheet, and show cash and receivables.

6
00:00:36,014 --> 00:00:40,793
We help set up the pack and the close, and check them against year-end.

